  "notes": [
    "Reuse immutable archived files and original MIT licenses; no new download or duplicate raw file.",
    "Four scoped hit clauses, twenty actual refinement descriptions; this is not a claim that four complete weapon mechanics are implemented.",
    "All R1–R5 coefficients checked individually against Chinese values and fixed gcsim expressions; only explicit hit-time state is restored.",
    "Current hit-time final HP or EM is required for the two additive-base clauses, including conversion-derived stats. Historical attack snapshots cannot replace these live bindings."
